cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SMART PLUG PROJECT
message: "If you use this project, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SMART PLUG PROJECT contributors"
abstract: >-
  A digital engineering package for an ESP32-S3 smart plug with PZEM-004T
  energy monitoring, off-board relay switching, local firmware, MQTT, a
  Fastify API, a Next.js dashboard, Android source, a device simulator, and a
  safety dossier. This is a prototype, not a certified or physically validated
  mains product.
repository-code: "https://github.com/jefryprr/smart-plug-project"
url: "https://github.com/jefryprr/smart-plug-project"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - esp32-s3
  - smart-plug
  - energy-monitoring
  - pzem-004t
  - mqtt
  - iot
  - kicad
  - hardware
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-16"
